# Hual04c input route (UU/seconds): cable-car ride, cabin ladder, grapple attempts.
# No teleports, grants, goal writes or control overrides.
# The game's HUD finishes its own slide-out and emits EndCartoonEffect; Telepherique0
# rides to its first point, explodes and returns control at ~24.983 s.
# Jump before crossing the open floor trap: walking off drops ~2000 UU (-114 HP).
# item88b: face the ladder's south LookDir, enter the opening horizontally, then look
# vertically up to climb. Retail PlayerClimbing uses view-space acceleration, not
# an unconditional vertical forward axis. Peak z=302.4, then settle at the ladder
# top (-1122.338,58.252,296.702). Navigation-preview TLcabine no longer collides.
# Walk east onto the roof; the game's supplied Hook is selected by InventoryNext
# and fired at HookPoint1. Spurious BreakAbleMover44 Touch (mesh TraceActors returns
# zero hits) calls HitWall and releases it. Return to the ladder by input to survive
# the same 120-second run, ending at (-1170.363,56.460,295.766),52HP.
# An unarrested descent costs 114 HP and is fatal
# under the live AI. This is a blocked route, not a completed helicopter mission.
# Goals 0/2/3 and kello01a travel remain unreached; completed goals 1/4/5/6 are
# authored anti-goals, not accomplishments of this route.
t=0.50 goto -3200 128
t=3.00 forward 0
t=26.00 yaw 180
t=26.00 forward 1
t=26.00 jump
t=26.65 yaw -90
t=26.65 pitch 0
t=26.65 forward 1
t=27.00 pitch 90
t=28.50 forward 0
t=28.50 next_item
t=30.00 yaw 0
t=30.00 pitch 0
t=30.00 forward 1
t=30.80 forward 0
t=30.80 track HookPoint1
t=31.30 fire_hold 1
t=31.50 fire_hold 0
t=31.60 track off
t=31.60 yaw 180
t=31.60 pitch 0
t=31.60 forward 1
t=32.45 yaw -90
t=32.45 pitch 90
t=33.00 forward 0
t=119.90 wait_travel
